<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="SZBeastParent">
    <defName>SZ_QiongQi</defName>
    <label>qiongqi</label>
    <description>There is a chance of one attacking the colony a year after it is founded. In Shenzhou legend the coming of a qiongqi means disaster without end; one of them was enough to scatter every sniper in a Shenzhou corps. \n\nThe Tianbing mechanoid clan's gene engineering took the "four fiends" of Shenzhou legend for its model, and succeeded in making a qiongqi. \n\nSurvivors say the qiongqi dodges nearly everything, and that this is the doing of its eye: the qiongqi eye reads an attack before it lands and gives the beast a 50% chance to dodge any source of damage. \n\nA qiongqi also picks the ranged units out of a line and throws itself at the furthest enemy in range. It aims for the head, which makes every one of its charges deadly.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>6.5</MoveSpeed>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.55</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.35</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <MeleeDodgeChance>0.5</MeleeDodgeChance>
    </statBases>
    <race>
      <thinkTreeMain>SZ_AIQiongQi</thinkTreeMain>
      <body>SZ_QuadrupedAnimalWithPawsTailWings</body>
    </race>
    <damageMultipliers>
      <li>
        <damageDef>AntiEvilBeastBullet</damageDef>
        <multiplier>6</multiplier>
      </li>
    </damageMultipliers>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>bite</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>SZ_QiongQiBite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>25</power>
        <cooldownTime>1</cooldownTime>
        <armorPenetration>1</armorPenetration>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Teeth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>left claw</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>SZ_QiongQiScratch</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>20</power>
        <cooldownTime>0.5</cooldownTime>
        <armorPenetration>1</armorPenetration>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>FrontLeftPaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>right claw</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>SZ_QiongQiScratch</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>20</power>
        <cooldownTime>0.5</cooldownTime>
        <armorPenetration>1</armorPenetration>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>FrontRightPaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <comps>
      <li>
        <compClass>AncientChineseBeast.CompQiongQiAIExpansion</compClass>
      </li>
      <li Class="AncientChineseBeast.CompProperties_ConnaturalAbilities">
        <abilities>
          <li>SZ_QiongQi_FlyingStrike</li>
        </abilities>
      </li>
      <li Class="AncientChineseBeast.CompProperties_GenesInCorpse">
        <genes>
          <li>SZGene_QiongQi_FlyingStrike</li>
          <li>SZGene_QiongQi_Eyes</li>
          <li>SZGene_QiongQi_Scratch</li>
        </genes>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="PawnFlyerBase">
